        {
          "id": 2029620138,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "`lrexlib` is an external library https://github.com/rrthomas/lrexlib so we should be minimal about the patches made. It might actually be better to reinsert the removed line about 5.1, as its still in the upstream package.\n\nBasically the same reasons we keep a lot of similar compatibility ifdefs in qcustomplot.",
