        {
          "id": 2032952548,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think so. I think it's easier to keep the Lua 5.1 ifdefs from upstream to keep our changes as minimal as possible (even though the upstream is pretty mature at this point and doesn't change much.) We do have a few changes to disable certain compiler warnings, for checkAPIs, etc.\n\nI can create a MR to restore the Lua 5.1 changes.",
